ential","price_band":"~$20-70/pp","timing":"Nov-Apr","draw_rank":2,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the delta''s tropical-fruit larder plus the gateway city''s legendary street food — phở, bánh mì, cơm tấm","si":"culinary","blurb":"the delta''s tropical-fruit larder plus the gateway city''s legendary street food — phở, bánh mì, cơm tấm","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"bundle/venue"},{"name":"Village cycling + sampan the canals","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$25-90/pp","timing":"year-round","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the delta''s active morning — cycle unpaved village lanes past orchards, then paddle a sampan through the narrow canals","si":"adventure","blurb":"the delta''s active morning — cycle unpaved village lanes past orchards, then paddle a sampan through the narrow canals","when":"year-round","commission":"operator/affiliate 10-15%"},{"name":"A small-ship river honeymoon","si_tag":"romance","status":"future","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$3,000-7,000+/pp","timing":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","draw_rank":1,"hook":"a suite on an Aqua Mekong-class 5-star ship, private sampan sunset and a delta cooking dinner — a quiet, unusual river honeymoon","si":"romance","blurb":"a suite on an Aqua Mekong-class 5-star ship, private sampan sunset and a delta cooking dinner — a quiet, unusual river honeymoon","when":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","commission":"cruise-line/host 10-16%"},{"name":"The low-exertion river cruise","si_tag":"senior","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~$2,500-5,000/pp","timing":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","draw_rank":1,"hook":"a gentle, all-in small-ship cruise with step-light delta excursions — a natural fit for the river-cruise senior demographic, HCMC the easy gateway","si":"senior","blurb":"a gentle, all-in small-ship cruise with step-light delta excursions — a natural fit for the river-cruise senior demographic, HCMC the easy gateway","when":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","commission":"cruise-line/DMC 10-16%"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in the Mekong Delta?","a":"Not crime - heat, traffic and the water: the delta is hot and humid year-round, Ho Chi Minh City traffic is dense, and canal sampans are small craft (follow crew, wear the life vest). Standard SE-Asia food-and-water hygiene applies.","source":"travel.state.gov","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is the Vietnam-Cambodia border crossing on a Mekong cruise a problem?","a":"No - the cruise river crossing at Tan Chau is open and routinely used by the ships. (Separately, some Cambodia-Thailand land borders are closed - that affects the Cambodia leg, not this Vietnamese one.)","source":"vikingrivercruises.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"When is the best time to cruise the Vietnamese Mekong?","a":"Roughly November-April, the drier cooler window, because the May-October wet season brings heavy afternoon rain and higher water - though the delta cruises year-round and high water opens more canals.","source":"aquaexpeditions.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"Which lines cruise the Vietnamese Mekong?","a":"Confirmed from Ho Chi Minh City: Viking, Aqua Expeditions, Uniworld, Scenic and Mekong Navigator - most on Vietnam-Cambodia itineraries linking the delta to Phnom Penh and Siem Reap.","source":"vikingrivercruises.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"What do you actually see in the Mekong Delta?","a":"River life: the Cai Be floating market, Sa Dec''s colonial streets and flower gardens, Ben Tre''s coconut canals by sampan, cooking classes with delta chefs, and - near the start - the Cu Chi tunnels of the Vietnam War.","source":"uniworld.com","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"Is the Mekong Delta good for a river-cruise honeymoon or for older travellers?","a":"Yes to both - small-ship 5-star cruising (Aqua Mekong ~40 guests) suits a quiet honeymoon, and the gentle all-in format with step-light excursions and HCMC as an easy gateway fits the river-cruise senior demographic.","source":"aquaexpeditions.com","si_tag":"romance"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Mekong Delta Vietnam Travel Guide: River Cruises, Floating Markets & Cu Chi","meta_description":"Plan Vietnam''s Mekong Delta — river cruises from Ho Chi Minh City (Viking, Aqua Expeditions, Uniworld, Scenic), Cai Be & Ben Tre by sampan, Sa Dec, cooking classes and the Cu Chi tunnels.","slug":"mekong-delta-vietnam","primary_keyword":"Mekong Delta Vietnam travel guide","long_tail":["Mekong Delta river cruise from Ho Chi Minh City 2026","Cai Be floating market","Ben Tre coconut canals sampan","Cu Chi tunnels tour","Vietnam Cambodia Mekong cruise","Aqua Mekong small-ship"],"search_language":"vi-VN","local_keywords":["Dong bang song Cuu Long","du thuyen song Mekong","cho noi Cai Be","Ben Tre","Sa Dec","dia dao Cu Chi","Thanh pho Ho Chi Minh","Tan Chau"],"hreflang":["en","vi-VN"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-29"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L1","codes":[],"advisory_updated":"2026-06-24","consent_flow":false,"note":"Vietnam US L1 (Exercise Normal Precautions), no carve-outs — cleanest of the 3 Mekong countries"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-29","hits":8,"misses":14,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; sports limited to My Sports Travel (participant); spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"river","name":"river","status":"live"},{"si":"culture","name":"Culture & History","status":"future"},{"si":"deepdive","name":"deepdive","status":"future"},{"si":"culinary","name":"culinary","status":"future"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"future"},{"si":"senior","name":"senior","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Aqua Mekong — 5-star small-ship suite (~40 guests)","why_ultra":"design ship with private-sampan excursion fleet, delta cooking + spa, Vietnam<->Cambodia Mekong","earning":"cruise-line/host 10-16%","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$4,000-9,000+/pp"},{"name":"Park Hyatt Saigon / The Reverie — HCMC ultra bookend","why_ultra":"top-tier gateway stay, spa + fine dining in District 1","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$300-800+/night"},{"name":"A private delta day — chartered sampan + delta chef''s table","why_ultra":"private canal boat + market-to-table lunch, chauffeured from HCMC","earning":"DMC + venue","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"luxury-ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-29","hero":{"query":"The Mekong Delta, Vietnam, Vietnam"},"geo":{"lat":10.0341,"lng":105.788}}'::jsonb, 7),
  ('raja-ampat-indonesia', '07A', 'Raja Ampat', 'Indonesia', 'The richest reef on the planet', 'live', 'verified', 'oceanAerial', 'Raja Ampat — Indonesia (Southwest Papua)', '{"liveaboard","adventure","diveglobal","ocean"}', '{}', '{"comfort","premier"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["NW-monsoon liveaboard sea, ~Oct-April (calmest/clearest); avoid Jun-Jul; seasonal inverse of Komodo; water ~28-30C","Three regions: Dampier Strait (Cape Kri - single-dive fish-count record, Blue Magic, Sardine Reef, Manta Sandy), Misool (Boo Windows, Magic Mountain, Four Kings), Wayag/north","Manta cleaning stations: Manta Sandy (Dampier) + Magic Mountain/Shadow Reef (Misool)","Fleet: Raja Ampat Aggressor (reseller line held), Explorer Ventures (reseller line held), Emperor Harmoni/Raja Laut, Master Indo Master, luxury phinisi (Damai/Dewi Nusantara/Mermaid/Arenui/Coralia)","Advisory: State L2 (reissued 30 Apr 2025; only Papua L4 = Central + Highland Papua; Raja Ampat/Southwest Papua outside both; FCDO points Papua caution at the highlands); nearest chamber Waisai but readiness not assured - evac to Manado/Bali; Wayag temporarily closed (verify) - all verified 2026-08-09"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 118 ambulance (verify)","hospital":"Waisai (Waigeo) clinic; Sorong for referral; serious care routes to Manado or Bali (verify)","hyperbaric":"Nearest chamber at Waisai (Waigeo), ~2-4h from sites (+62-951-3173358) but readiness NOT assured - no reliably operational chamber in Papua per dive-medicine sources; DAN-documented case evacuated a diver to Bali (~2,000 km, ~7h via Sorong); Manado the other referral. Confirm status + carry evacuation cover (source: papuaparadise.com + stayrajaampat.com, 2026-08-09)","advisory_level":"L2","regional_hazard":"LIVE: Wayag + Manyaifun/Batangpele reported temporarily closed over nickel-mining disputes - verify northern-route access (rajaampatbiodiversity.com, 2026-08-09)","no_fly_after_diving":"18-24h (DAN)","malaria":"present in Raja Ampat/Papua - discuss prophylaxis (verify)","yellow_fever":"only if arriving from an endemic country","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel FCDO advises against all travel to a number of volcanoes in Indonesia: Mount Lewotobi Laki-Laki, on Flores Island, East Nusa Tenggara Province to within 7km of the crater Mount Sinabung, Karo Regency, North Sumatra to within 5km of the crater Mount Marapi, West Sumatra to within 3km of the crater Mount Semeru, Lumajang Regency, East Java to within 5km of the crater in the south-east of Mount Semura to within 500m from any riverbank of the Besuk Kobokan river for 13km from the crater Mount Ruang, Northern Sulawesi to within 7km of the crater Mount Ibu, North Maluku Province to within 7km of the crater See more details about why FCDO advises against travel ."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to within 7km of the crater of Mount Lewotobi Laki-Laki on Flores Island, East Nusa Tenggara province."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to within 5km of the crater of Mount Sinabung in Karo Regency, North Sumatra."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to within 3km of the crater of Mount Marapi in West Sumatra."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to: within 5 km of the crater of Mount Semeru in Lumajang Regency, East Java the south-east area of Mount Semeru along the Besuk Kobokan river, approximately 13km from the crater, and 500m from any Besuk Kobokan riverbank These areas align with exclusion zones put in place by the local authorities."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to within 7km of the crater of Mount Ruang in Northern Sulawesi."},{"form":"against all travel","text":"advises against all travel to within 7km of the crater of Mount Ibu in North Maluku Province."}],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-08-16T12:31:33+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Oct-Apr (NW monsoon - calmest, clearest)","shoulder":"May & Sep (season edges)","green":"Jun-Aug (SE monsoon; roughest Jun-Jul; boats reposition to Komodo)","booking_lead":"peak preferred vessels ~6-12 months; shoulder nearer term; confirm per-vessel","off_season_specials":"season-edge shoulder weeks lower demand","event_peaks":"Oct-Apr window is the demand season; manta stations run within it","campaign_start":"wet-season fire Jun-Jul (inverse of the Komodo campaign; sell as a paired Indonesian dive year)"},"jewels":[{"name":"Cape Kri (Dampier Strait)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"holds a record for the most fish species on a single dive; the marquee reef dive","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"holds a record for the most fish species on a single dive; the marquee reef dive","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct (Aggressor/Explorer)"},{"name":"Blue Magic (Dampier Strait)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"strong-current pinnacle; barracuda, trevally, mantas","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"strong-current pinnacle; barracuda, trevally, mantas","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Sardine Reef (Dampier Strait)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"dense schooling reef in current","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://blog.padi.com/liveaboard-trip-raja-ampat/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"dense schooling reef in current","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Manta Sandy (Dampier Strait)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"the northern manta cleaning station","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"the northern manta cleaning station","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Arborek Jetty (Dampier Strait)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"comfort","hook":"jetty macro and schooling fish; snorkel-friendly","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://blog.padi.com/liveaboard-trip-raja-ampat/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"jetty macro and schooling fish; snorkel-friendly","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Mioskon (Dampier Strait)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"comfort","hook":"dusk reef, wobbegong sharks","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://blog.padi.com/liveaboard-trip-raja-ampat/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"dusk reef, wobbegong sharks","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"The Passage (Waigeo-Gam)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"a mangrove tidal channel dived like a jungle river","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"a mangrove tidal channel dived like a jungle river","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Boo Windows (Misool)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"the Misool signature; wall swim-throughs that glow in the sun","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"the Misool signature; wall swim-throughs that glow in the sun","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Magic Mountain / Shadow Reef (Misool)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"reef and oceanic manta cleaning seamount","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"reef and oceanic manta cleaning seamount","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Four Kings (Misool)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"four soft-coral pinnacles rising from the seafloor","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"four soft-coral pinnacles rising from the seafloor","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Fiabacet / Nudi Rock (Misool)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"comfort","hook":"soft-coral gardens, reef sharks, pygmy seahorses","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://www.lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"soft-coral gardens, reef sharks, pygmy seahorses","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Melissa''s Garden (Fam)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"a hard-coral garden in the central-north Fam group","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://blog.padi.com/liveaboard-trip-raja-ampat/","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"a hard-coral garden in the central-north Fam group","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Kawe / Wayag (north)","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"remote reefs and manta grounds under the Wayag karst; note the reported temporary access closure at Wayag - verify","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","source":"https://rajaampatbiodiversity.com/traveling-to-papua-is-it-safe/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"remote reefs and manta grounds under the Wayag karst; note the reported temporary access closure at Wayag - verify","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Dampier-Misool liveaboard route","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"the classic 7-12-night arc across the central and southern regions","bookable_category":"liveaboard week","source":"https://blog.padi.com/liveaboard-trip-raja-ampat/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"the classic 7-12-night arc across the central and southern regions","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"fleet-direct (Aggressor/Explorer)"},{"name":"Wayag karst + Waigeo birds-of-paradise","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"premier","hook":"karst-island viewpoint + ranger-guided red bird-of-paradise walks ashore","bookable_category":"liveaboard-included excursion / DMC","source":"https://divernet.com/features/about-raja-ampat/","timing":"Oct-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","blurb":"karst-island viewpoint + ranger-guided red bird-of-paradise walks ashore","when":"Oct-Apr","commission":"DMC / excursion pass-through"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is the current advisory for Raja Ampat, and how do I dive it responsibly?","a":"The U.S. State Department places Indonesia at Level 2 - Exercise Increased Caution (reissued 30 April 2025). Its only Level 4 (Do Not Travel) carve-outs are Central Papua (Papua Tengah) and Highland Papua (Papua Pegunungan); Raja Ampat sits in Southwest Papua (Papua Barat Daya), outside both, at the country caution baseline. The UK FCDO issues no formal advise-against level for Papua but notes armed separatist violence mainly in Highland and Central Papua, calls that security picture unpredictable, and says to take local advice; it does not name Raja Ampat. The stricter reading - the State Level 2 baseline plus the broader Papua-context caveat - sets the posture. One live note: Wayag Island and the Manyaifun/Batangpele area were reported temporarily closed to visitors over local nickel-mining disputes, so confirm current access for northern itineraries. Carry DAN membership plus dive-accident insurance with strong evacuation cover, and observe an 18-24 hour no-fly window after diving.","source":"travel.state.gov/en/international-travel/travel-advisories/indonesia.html + gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia/regional-risks + rajaampatbiodiversity.com (all accessed 2026-08-09)","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is there a recompression chamber, and how remote is care?","a":"The nearest recompression chamber is in Waisai, the regency capital on Waigeo, roughly 2-4 hours from the dive sites. Its readiness cannot be assumed: dive-medicine sources warn there is no reliably operational chamber in Papua, and a DAN-documented case describes the Waisai chamber being under repair with the diver evacuated to Bali - nearly 2,000 km and around seven hours'' flying (about four hours to Sorong, three more to Bali); Manado in North Sulawesi is the other referral. Treat Waisai as the nearest option, confirm its status through the operator or DAN, and carry evacuation insurance that will actually move you. Conservative profiles and nitrox matter more here than almost anywhere.","source":"papuaparadise.com/news/diving-safely-in-raja-ampat + stayrajaampat.com (accessed 2026-08-09)","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"When is the best time to dive Raja Ampat?","a":"The main liveaboard window is roughly October-April, when seas are calmer and visibility is at its clearest; June-July brings the most unpredictable conditions and is best avoided, and several boats reposition to Komodo for the Southeast-monsoon dry season. Water stays around 28-30C year-round.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia + blog.padi.com/liveaboard-trip-raja-ampat","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"Where do I see mantas, and what is the marquee dive?","a":"Manta Sandy in the Dampier Strait and Magic Mountain (Shadow Reef) in Misool are the two manta cleaning stations - reef mantas through much of the year and oceanic mantas in season at Magic Mountain. The marquee reef dive is Cape Kri, which holds a record for the most fish species logged on a single dive.","source":"lagaligoliveaboard.com/top-10-raja-ampat-dive-sites-you-can-only-reach-by-liveaboard","si_tag":"liveaboard"},{"q":"Dampier Strait, Misool or Wayag - how does a liveaboard week split?","a":"Most trips run 7-12 nights to cover the three regions: the Dampier Strait in the centre (Cape Kri, Blue Magic, Sardine Reef, Manta Sandy, Arborek), Misool in the south (Boo Windows, Magic Mountain, Four Kings, Fiabacet) and the Wayag/north karst seascape (Kawe, The Passage). Longer charters reach all three; shorter ones concentrate on Dampier and one wing.","source":"blog.padi.com/liveaboard-trip-raja-ampat + lagaligoliveaboard.com","si_tag":"liveaboard"},{"q":"What conditions and certification should I plan for?","a":"Many of the best sites - Blue Magic, Cape Kri, Sardine Reef - are current-driven drift dives where a reef hook and good buoyancy earn their place; sheltered reefs, jetties (Arborek) and the mangrove channel of The Passage suit a wider range with a guide. Nitrox is standard on liveaboards for the repetitive multi-day profile. Dive within your certification and the operator briefing.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si_tag":"liveaboard"},{"q":"How far ahead do Raja Ampat liveaboards book?","a":"The October-April peak on preferred vessels fills earliest - the dedicated Raja Ampat vessels and luxury phinisi are booked well ahead; hold roughly 6-12 months out for peak windows and marquee boats, nearer term for the shoulder. Confirm per-vessel lead times with the operator.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si_tag":"planning"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Raja Ampat Liveaboard Diving: Reefs, Mantas & Season","meta_description":"Raja Ampat dive-liveaboard guide - Cape Kri and the Dampier Strait, Misool''s soft-coral walls, the Wayag north, the Oct-April season, operators and safety.","slug":"raja-ampat-indonesia","primary_keyword":"Raja Ampat liveaboard diving","long_tail":["Cape Kri Raja Ampat","Misool dive sites","Manta Sandy Raja Ampat","Raja Ampat dive season","Raja Ampat liveaboard operators"],"search_language":"id (restated, not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["menyelam Raja Ampat","liveaboard Raja Ampat","Selat Dampier"],"hreflang":["en","id"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-08-09"},"booking":{"bin":"freely bookable (L2)","level":"L2 (Exercise Increased Caution)","codes":["L2"],"consent_flow":false,"note":"US State Dept Level 2, reissued 30 Apr 2025, accessed 2026-08-09 (travel.state.gov/en/.../indonesia.html). ONLY Level 4 (Do Not Travel) carve-outs: Central Papua (Papua Tengah) + Highland Papua (Papua Pegunungan). Raja Ampat is in Southwest Papua (Papua Barat Daya), outside both. FCDO cross-check (gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia/regional-risks, accessed 2026-08-09): no formal advise-against level for Papua; flags armed separatist violence mainly in Highland + Central Papua, security unpredictable, take local advice; does not name Raja Ampat. Stricter reading = State L2 baseline + Papua-context caveat. LIVE ACCESS FLAG: Wayag + Manyaifun/Batangpele reported temporarily closed over nickel-mining disputes - verify northern-route access."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-08-09","hits":4,"misses":18,"disregarded":3,"note":"Liveaboard-diving scope; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"liveaboard","name":"liveaboard","status":"live"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"diveglobal","name":"diveglobal","status":"future"},{"si":"ocean","name":"ocean","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Private-charter luxury phinisi (Dewi Nusantara/Damai/Arenui-class) full three-region arc + Sorong pre/post; optional paired two-season Indonesian dive year with Komodo","why_ultra":"the Raja Ampat ultra pull is a private luxury-phinisi charter across all three regions, with a rare Komodo pairing across the seasons","earning":"held Aggressor/Explorer reseller lines; verify luxury-phinisi charter terms","virtuoso_value_add":"verify - not documented","mor":"commission-on-net; no net-rate resale markup","source":"handoff/LIVEABOARD-OPERATOR-GRID-2026-08-09.md"}],"source_verified":"2026-08-09","hero":{"query":"Raja Ampat, Indonesia"},"geo":{"lat":-0.55,"lng":130.5}}'::jsonb, 8),
