ALANCHE COUNTRY, NO dedicated JAN bulletin: file Backcountry Plan Report with Nozawa Ski Patrol before departing + consult JAN (nadare.jp) + JMA Nagano/Niigata forecasts; backcountry with beacon/probe/shovel + guide only; tree-well/deep-snow immersion suffocation risk (documented fatalities - never ski trees alone); cold/whiteout","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/japan","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-08-19T15:40:39+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Deep winter (Christmas/NY + Jan-Feb powder heart + 15 Jan Fire Festival + Lunar New Year + Australian January); limited village beds + multiples/min-stay","shoulder":"Late Nov-mid Dec (early season) + Mar-early May (spring, spring pass from 1 Mar)","green":"May-Nov green season (MTB/gondola summer, hiking, fishing, festivals; lowest rates)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Jan + Fire Festival + best ryokan/chalets 6-12 mo; regular winter 3-6 mo; shoulder 1-3 mo; deposit >90d=20%, <=90d=100%","off_season_specials":"Green-season MTB/hiking/fishing (Jun-Sep); spring-powder value (Mar-Apr); long-stay winter apartments (Nozawa Central from ~JPY 360,000/mo 2-bed)","event_peaks":"Dosojin Fire Festival (15 Jan - sharpest), Christmas/NY, Japanese New Year (Shogatsu), Lunar New Year, Australian school holidays (all January)","campaign_start":"Next winter + Fire-Festival weeks + best ryokan/chalets by prior spring/summer (6-12 mo); spring powder from Jan; green-season Nozawa from late winter"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski Mt Kenashi''s 1,085 m vertical of tree powder","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~JPY 7,500/day; multi-day cheaper/day (approx)","timing":"ski ~late Nov-early May; powder heart Dec-Feb","draw_rank":1,"hook":"from the 1,650 m summit to the village, Nozawa''s tree-lined pistes and designated powder areas serve up deep","si":"ski","blurb":"from the 1,650 m summit to the village, Nozawa''s tree-lined pistes and designated powder areas serve 